{"identity_key": "bilibili:1272729378978004993", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1272729378978004993", "content": "Hive的规模“Phase”是什么👀？\n作为BETA巢穴的Hive，存在一种分阶段表示其规模的尺度，——“Phase”。\n地球上规模最大的喀什Hive被认定为“Phase 6”，\n但放眼宇宙规模，火星的埃利西姆平原上存在着一个被称为“Mars Zero”的“Phase 9”Hive。\n\n#Muv-Luv#", "publisher": "Muv-Luv官方", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1272729378978004993", "published_at": "2026-11-20T10:00:00+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T15:27:32.922392+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/d9dda834ff0e070c48dea0fa13b3fc4b3546900143802616.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3546900143802616", "uid": "3546900143802616", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "Hive的规模“Phase”是什么👀？", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 21, "retweets": 1, "replies": 0}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
